<title>DUBAI: Emirates receives third Boeing 777.</title>
<headline>Emirates receives third Boeing 777.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dubai government-owned Emirates airline said on Monday it has taken delivery of its third Boeing 777 aircraft.</p>
<p>An Emirates statement said the aircraft arrived in Dubai on October 17. The airline earlier this month said it signed a $126 million financing agreement with an international consortium of banks for the third 777 on order.</p>
<p>Emirates has received two Boeing 777s of the seven on firm order. It has options on seven more 777s.</p>
</text>
